# Deaths in armed conflicts — Uppsala Conflict Data Program (UCDP)
# Dataset: UCDP Country-Year Dataset on Organized Violence within Country Borders, version 26.1
# Retrieved 2026-11-10 directly from https://ucdp.uu.se/downloads/ (organizedviolencecy-261-csv.zip). Licence: CC BY 4.0
# Citation: Davies, Pettersson and Öberg (2026), Organized violence 1989–2025, and violent political protests, Journal of Peace Research; Sundberg and Melander (2013), Introducing the UCDP Georeferenced Event Dataset, Journal of Peace Research 50(4)
# Value: best estimate, state-based + non-state + one-sided violence (sb_total_deaths_best + ns_total_deaths_best + os_total_deaths_best), counted in the country where the deaths occurred
# Country coverage follows UCDP: "Russia (Soviet Union)", "Serbia (Yugoslavia)" and "Yemen (North Yemen)" are filed under Russia, Serbia and Yemen for all years. Czechoslovakia, East Germany and South Yemen (all zero) are left out.
# Unit: deaths; category: military; higher_is_better: False
# iso2|year|value|projection
